# Evolve (CR 702.100a, the rulings): Cloudfin Raptor (0/1) triggers on Merfolk of the Pearl Trident (1/1). In response
# Lightning Bolt kills the Merfolk. The ability still resolves, and compares the stats the Merfolk last had on the battlefield
# (power 1 > 0), so the Raptor gets its counter. Black Lotus and Mox Sapphire pay for the creatures, Mox Ruby for the Bolt.

